<Aside title="Bring your own ROM">
	No ROM ships with these pages. Pick a <code>.gb</code> file from your own machine;
	nothing is uploaded, it is read straight into the emulator running in this tab.
	Sound starts on that pick, since browsers only allow audio after a user gesture.
	Controls: arrow keys, <kbd>Z</kbd> (A), <kbd>X</kbd> (B), <kbd>Enter</kbd> (Start),
	right <kbd>Shift</kbd> (Select), or a gamepad.
</Aside>
